WEBVTT

00:01:29.473 --> 00:01:33.012
One friend said,
"You really messed with me."

00:01:33.503 --> 00:01:36.137
I said, "Yeah, well, get in line."

00:01:36.161 --> 00:01:41.611
They said, "You were my only example
of an alpha male who was gentle."

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:44.572
And I thought, "Oh. You're right."

00:01:45.108 --> 00:01:47.372
I was an alpha male.

00:01:47.396 --> 00:01:49.161
And I was gentle.

00:01:49.715 --> 00:01:52.065
And if it was hard for him,

00:01:52.089 --> 00:01:55.648
how much more difficult
was it for my own son?

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.503
Jonathan Williams: Estrangement
was not an option.

00:01:59.527 --> 00:02:02.567
It was Father's Day and my girls
brought me craft beer